      <title>国家电影局公示陆川《登月计划》备案 航天救援员故事再探科幻</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/edudaily/post/20260902/%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E7%94%B5%E5%BD%B1%E5%B1%80%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BA%E9%99%86%E5%B7%9D%E7%99%BB%E6%9C%88%E8%AE%A1%E5%88%92%E5%A4%87%E6%A1%88-%E8%88%AA%E5%A4%A9%E6%95%91%E6%8F%B4%E5%91%98%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E5%86%8D%E6%8E%A2%E7%A7%91%E5%B9%BB/</link>
